sequenceDiagram
    actor User as 用户
    participant Detail as detailPage:Detail
    participant Workflow as workflow:OrderWorkflowService
    participant Deal as deal:GroupDeal
    participant Order as order:Order
    participant Coupon as couponIndex
    participant Store as store:DemoStore
    User->>Detail: 选择套餐和数量
    Detail->>Workflow: createGroupOrder(user,dealId,quantity)
    Workflow->>Deal: 校验 active、quantity、stock
    Workflow->>Order: 创建 GROUP_BUY/PENDING_PAYMENT
    Workflow->>Store: 保存订单
    User->>Detail: 支付订单
    Detail->>Workflow: pay(user,orderId,clientRequestId)
    Workflow->>Store: 检查 clientRequestId
    Workflow->>Deal: stock -= quantity
    Workflow->>Order: status=PAID
    Workflow->>Coupon: 生成并索引 12 位券码
    Coupon-->>Order: couponCode
    Order-->>Detail: PAID + couponCode
    alt 重复支付
        Store-->>Workflow: 返回原支付结果，不重复扣库存/生成券码
    end
